guide:

This is the same proposition as @VII.3 with the same diagram and the same corollary, only the terminology is slightly different.

This proposition and its corollary are used in the next proposition.
----
red_highlight: yes
#### prop_section ####
kind: corollary
----
statement: If a magnitude measures two magnitudes, then it also measures their greatest common measure.
----
proof: From this it is clear that, *if a magnitude measures two magnitudes, then it also measures their greatest common measure.*
